    "claims": [
     {
      "claim_id": "claim_1",
      "text": "以下是《论语·公冶长》「宰予昼寝」一节的孔子原话",
      "epistemic_type": "UNKNOWN",
      "role": "INTERPRETIVE_CLAIM",
      "evidence_ids": [],
      "direct_evidence": false
     },
     {
      "claim_id": "claim_2",
      "text": "> 宰予昼寝，子曰：“**朽木不可雕也，粪土之墙不可圬也，于予与何诛",
      "epistemic_type": "UNKNOWN",
      "role": "INTERPRETIVE_CLAIM",
      "evidence_ids": [],
      "direct_evidence": false
     },
     {
      "claim_id": "claim_3",
      "text": "**”子曰：“**始吾于人也，听其言而信其行",
      "epistemic_type": "UNKNOWN",
      "role": "INTERPRETIVE_CLAIM",
      "evidence_ids": [],
      "direct_evidence": false
     },
     {
      "claim_id": "claim_4",
      "text": "今吾于人也，听其言而观其行",
      "epistemic_type": "UNKNOWN",
      "role": "INTERPRETIVE_CLAIM",
      "evidence_ids": [],
      "direct_evidence": false
     },
     {
      "claim_id": "claim_5",
      "text": "**出处：**【《论语》· 公冶长篇】",
      "epistemic_type": "SOURCE_FACT",
      "role": "TEXTUAL_CLAIM",
      "evidence_ids": [
       "ev_25"
      ],
      "direct_evidence": true
     },
     {
      "claim_id": "claim_6",
      "text": "1. **原句字形**：本句「粪土之墙不可**圬**也」，通行的字写作「圬」（或作「杇」），本检索版本作「圬」，我依库内版本逐字引用",
      "epistemic_type": "UNKNOWN",
      "role": "INTERPRETIVE_CLAIM",
      "evidence_ids": [],
      "direct_evidence": false
     },
     {
      "claim_id": "claim_7",
      "text": "此字同义异形，不同版本偶见「杇」",
      "epistemic_type": "UNKNOWN",
      "role": "INTERPRETIVE_CLAIM",
      "evidence_ids": [],
      "direct_evidence": false
     },
     {
      "claim_id": "claim_8",
      "text": "2. **孔子在本节中的说话其实是两句**：第一段是借「朽木」「粪土之墙」喻宰予不足惜、不值得责备",
      "epistemic_type": "UNKNOWN",
      "role": "INTERPRETIVE_CLAIM",
      "evidence_ids": [],
      "direct_evidence": false
     },
     {
      "claim_id": "claim_9",
      "text": "第二段则是引申出他认知方式的改变——从「听其言而信其行」转为「听其言而观其行」",
      "epistemic_type": "UNKNOWN",
      "role": "INTERPRETIVE_CLAIM",
      "evidence_ids": [],
      "direct_evidence": false
     },
     {
      "claim_id": "claim_10",
      "text": "故本章文献多记为两处「子曰」",
      "epistemic_type": "UNKNOWN",
      "role": "INTERPRETIVE_CLAIM",
      "evidence_ids": [],
      "direct_evidence": false
     },
     {
      "claim_id": "claim_11",
      "text": "3. **逐字引用依据**：以上文字直接读取自库内【《论语》·公冶长篇】该章全文并逐字核对，非凭记忆转述",
      "epistemic_type": "SOURCE_FACT",
      "role": "TEXTUAL_CLAIM",
      "evidence_ids": [
       "ev_25"
      ],
      "direct_evidence": true
     },
     {
      "claim_id": "claim_12",
      "text": "4. 需要提醒的一点是：孔子此处所言「于予与何诛」「于予与改是」中的「与」为语气助词，两处原文皆用「与」而非「欤」，我按库本原貌保留，未作雅化处理",
      "epistemic_type": "UNKNOWN",
      "role": "INTERPRETIVE_CLAIM",
      "evidence_ids": [],
      "direct_evidence": false
     }
